p Final. He moved to Crystal Palace in December 1967. He moved back to Leyton Orient, before moving onto non-league football where he saw out his football career.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T16:05:28.383962+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 4622, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Lazarus"}], "uuid": "1ee7ac4d-9cdc-4e24-8c91-1be07de54ec3", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "24514", "external_references": [{"id": 25080, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q6768522"}], "date_modified": "2023-08-01T16:05:28.405290+10:00"}, {"id": 80837, "name": "Tidy Town Pictures", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2104652, "title": "Australian rules (A) [DVD]", "work_id": 94508, "role": "production company", "role_id": 941, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-05-09T12:36:44.235226+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "376cccda-1f17-40fc-8be9-b29daac83b4f", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "13511", "external_references": [{"id": 42917, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q121091175"}], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 80836, "name": "Eddie L.C. Fong", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2351234, "title": "The Goddess of 1967 [DVD]", "work_id": 94506, "role": "co-producer", "role_id": 915, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 916910, "title": "Letters to Ali [DVD]", "work_id": 94977, "role": "co-producer", "role_id": 915, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-05-09T19:56:26.268206+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "d4337006-2f39-4690-aaba-8072d7460c14", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "sourc